FF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c134ed5c3f6115a892564c1dc260bd8f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@inabaoden/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9db7e226/uploads/origins/22fedce6-4b90-408e-b27e-2f0326a883c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55474c8f05f273f95d4e929542ea7e33", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9db7e226/uploads/origins/22fedce6-4b90-408e-b27e-2f0326a883c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55474c8f05f273f95d4e929542ea7e33, https://si.imgix.net/9db7e226/uploads/origins/22fedce6-4b90-408e-b27e-2f0326a883c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eba37e454a23a295f3451d01e49b1b46 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9db7e226/uploads/origins/22fedce6-4b90-408e-b27e-2f0326a883c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7187aac448660e8c524245e258d29d41 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "前回描いていただいたこのイラストがとても気に入っておりまして、カラー版を描いていただきたいです！\nご検討よろしくお願いします！(リンクを貼れていなかったので再送させていただきました、失礼いたしました)\nhttps://skeb.jp/@inabaoden/works/15\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@inabaoden/works/15", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@inabaoden/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce3cc486/uploads/origins/9c5af753-acb9-4dbf-a5f5-6f550d28357e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d1b53b6b0aa0883ee241dffb4bac95fa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ce3cc486/uploads/origins/9c5af753-acb9-4dbf-a5f5-6f550d28357e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d1b53b6b0aa0883ee241dffb4bac95fa, https://si.imgix.net/ce3cc486/uploads/origins/9c5af753-acb9-4dbf-a5f5-6f550d28357e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ef854dad078c51da0eabeb3ebd14dfa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ce3cc486/uploads/origins/9c5af753-acb9-4dbf-